    skos:scopeNote "Document-attested minor 19th-century commodity absent as a standalone line in Layer-1 British/Canadian customs ledgers; typically subsumed under htc:0220 (Gum Unenumerated). Attested in: P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 22, Thomas Mortimer (rev. Dickinson), A General Commercial Dictionary (1823), scan p. 53."@en ;
